1N     Pass   3N     Pass
Pass   Pass
{[show S]

The opponents have bid to 3NT and it is your lead. You hold \SKQT9 — choose your card.

When you have chosen, click NEXT. [choose-card SQ] [NEXT]

[show NESW]

Lead the \SQ from \SKQT9 — the lower of your top honours, asking partner about the jack. Holding it, partner unblocks under your queen (as here) and the suit is safe to run once the ace is knocked out. Lacking it, partner gives count instead — declarer has the jack, and the count tells you whether to continue or shift.}

