{[show S]

The opponents have bid to 3NT and it is your lead. You hold \SQJ98 — choose your card.

When you have chosen, click NEXT. [choose-card SJ] [NEXT]

[show NESW]

Lead the \SJ from \SQJ98 — the lower of your top honours, asking partner about the ten. Holding it, partner unblocks under your jack (as here) and your \SQ-9-8 cash once the ace and king are gone. Lacking it, partner gives count — declarer has the ten, and the count guides whether to continue or shift.}

